    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action! Suspense! Comedy! Heartbreak! Angst! Cats! Aliens! Cat aliens! Lots of cat aliens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield magic, discover secrets, and explore the mysterious dream-like world of Cubaria through an upcoming Turn-Based Chess-like RPG for Windows Systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is at its dusk.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the command of their grandfather's final wish, two siblings find themselves on a grand adventure to save the sun from setting forever. Trapped in one body, they must work together to solve puzzles, discover secrets, and battle fearsome foes. Only then will they collect the 6 Key Pieces to the Daystrike - a mysterious machine that stands between forever darkness and peace throughout the land of Cubaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can they save the world from eternal shadow?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a parallel world to Cubaria, a comic that takes place during and after the events of this game. This game will be a requirement for understanding the later parts of the comic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character-rich story with an emphasis on comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670340/extras/d3bed418fe5ee7c222c19a6e833b28f8.avif?t=1747487041\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat, frog, rock, jelly, and squid-like aliens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanically deep combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riveting puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670340/extras/ee371f21aaed8c647e2307ef8d43de81.avif?t=1747487041\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handy magic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one guy, known as me</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least a handful of outdated references - the game is set in 2008 after all...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One deer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670340/extras/fe579f7a2e6ddb42cb70d306e59d4eca.avif?t=1747487041\" width=273 height=284 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, now <span class=\"bb_strike\">play</span> patiently wait for the game, please.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action! Suspense! Comedy! Heartbreak! Angst! Cats! Aliens! Cat aliens! Lots of cat aliens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield magic, discover secrets, and explore the mysterious dream-like world of Cubaria through an upcoming Turn-Based Chess-like RPG for Windows Systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is at its dusk.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the command of their grandfather's final wish, two siblings find themselves on a grand adventure to save the sun from setting forever. Trapped in one body, they must work together to solve puzzles, discover secrets, and battle fearsome foes. Only then will they collect the 6 Key Pieces to the Daystrike - a mysterious machine that stands between forever darkness and peace throughout the land of Cubaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can they save the world from eternal shadow?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a parallel world to Cubaria, a comic that takes place during and after the events of this game. This game will be a requirement for understanding the later parts of the comic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character-rich story with an emphasis on comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670340/extras/d3bed418fe5ee7c222c19a6e833b28f8.avif?t=1747487041\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat, frog, rock, jelly, and squid-like aliens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanically deep combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riveting puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670340/extras/ee371f21a